Z||000008||johnt671||08-27-2001||07:09 PM||||12 shows the start of the test, 14 is low voltage at your coolent sensor which makes the ecm think your car is cold and causes it to run rich, and there is no 4 code.  Recheck and see if it is a 22 which is the throttle pos. sensor. Then you should see three more 12's to show the end of the test.||||reg||1
